A full-screen program which allows multiple phone calls to other
unix users is available.  This program, originally from
Jim Rees @ uw-beaver, was extensively modified by Chris Torek @ umcp-cs.
The program now runs under 4BSD unix systems with CMU IPC, and uses the
Maryland Windows Package.  If your 4bsd system has CMU IPC, and you
obtain the windows package (send mail to liz@umcp-cs, to get the maryland
software distribution tape), then you can use phone.  To get phone,
just send me mail.

  --Jim O'Toole


